    "problemName": "prime-arrangements",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def numPrimeArrangements(self, n: int) -> int:\r\n        def count(n):\r\n            cnt = 0\r\n            primes = [True] * (n + 1)\r\n            for i in range(2, n + 1):\r\n                if primes[i]:\r\n                    cnt += 1\r\n                    for j in range(i + i, n + 1, i):\r\n                        primes[j] = False\r\n            return cnt\r\n\r\n        cnt = count(n)\r\n        ans = factorial(cnt) * factorial(n - cnt)\r\n        return ans % (10**9 + 7)",
